{"type": "message", "id": "02a72aea", "parentId": "b7f4ae75", "timestamp": "2026-04-16T16:07:09.274Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_a316f0224ff04131856dfa70", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"Kansas median home price January 2023 $290,000\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"tookMs\": 983,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"031581062f1e4f8c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nKansas Housing Market: House Prices & Trends | Redfin\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"031581062f1e4f8c\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.redfin.com/state/Kansas/housing-market\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"86ce028e4110c018\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe direction and pace at which home prices are changing are indicators of the strength of the housing market and whether homes are becoming more or less affordable. <strong>The median price of a home in the United States is currently $286,000</strong>.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"86ce028e4110c018\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.redfin.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d299b39d64aa8bcf\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nKansas Housing Market Stats – January 2023 - Kansas REALTORS®\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"d299b39d64aa8bcf\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://kansasrealtor.com/kansas-housing-market-stats-january-2023/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"64e52b63084de666\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n“Sales activity last month was the lowest January figure we’ve seen since 2015,” said KAR president Thomas Howe with McGrew Real Estate in Lawrence. “At that time, however, there were nearly two-and-a-half times as many homes available for sale. As a result, it remains a sellers’ market across most of the state.” January 2023 Market […]\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"64e52b63084de666\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"March 1, 2023\",\n      \"siteName\": \"kansasrealtor.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"805f481cb4a53278\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAll-Transactions House Price Index for Kansas City, MO-KS (MSA) (ATNHPIUS28140Q) | FRED | St. Louis Fed\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"805f481cb4a53278\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://fred.stlouisfed.org/series/ATNHPIUS28140Q\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"77605bc7864dd720\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nGraph and download economic data for All-Transactions House Price Index for Kansas City, MO-KS (MSA) (ATNHPIUS28140Q) from Q1 1976 to Q4 2025 about Kansas City, KS, appraisers, MO, HPI, housing, price index, indexes, price, and USA.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"77605bc7864dd720\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"February 24, 2026\",\n      \"siteName\": \"fred.stlouisfed.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"45e8823267e66129\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nHousing Market & Prices Kansas 2023 - Home Value Estimator\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"45e8823267e66129\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://realadvisor.com/housing-market-kansas/\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3734db39efac9a6c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nWith a population of 126,587, Topeka is the capital city of the state of Kansas. Topeka’s housing market is very competitive, with houses going pending 27 days on average after listing. Multiple offer situations are common, and the average homes sell for about 2% above the list price. As of September 2022, Topeka home prices were up 7.1% compared to last year, selling for a median price of $150,000, with listing prices ranging from $10,000 to 3.7 million dollars.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3734db39efac9a6c\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"February 15, 2023\",\n      \"siteName\": \"realadvisor.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"9a1fff60acb8d277\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nKansas City Housing Market: House Prices & Trends | Redfin\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"9a1fff60acb8d277\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.redfin.com/city/35751/MO/Kansas-City/housing-market\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b3c49a4eab969cfa\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe Kansas City housing market is somewhat competitive. Homes in Kansas City receive 2 offers on average and sell in around 58 days. The median sale price of a home in Kansas City was <strong>$274K</strong> last month, down 0.35% since last year.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b3c49a4eab969cfa\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.redfin.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3db1ff0b2fddd79b\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nAll-Transactions House Price Index for Kansas (KSSTHPI) | FRED | St. Louis Fed\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3db1ff0b2fddd79b\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://fred.stlouisfed.org/series/KSSTHPI\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f86877ab7db003b7\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nGraph and download economic data for All-Transactions House Price Index for Kansas (KSSTHPI) from Q1 1975 to Q4 2025 about KS, appraisers, HPI, housing, price index, indexes, price, and USA.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f86877ab7db003b7\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"February 24, 2026\",\n      \"siteName\": \"fred.stlouisfed.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"58c81b1ee63bf249\\\">>>\\nSource: Web S